l occupation or blockade plans. This comes as the U.S. deploys additional Marines to the Middle East amid an effective Iranian blockade of the Strait of Hormuz.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-can-take-out-irans-kharg-island-at-any-time-warns-white-house/articleshow/129711365.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-can-take-out-irans-kharg-island-at-any-time-warns-white-house/articleshow/129711365.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-21T05:35:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129711432,imgsize-492490.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Detached from reality': Iran slams US over 'winning' claims, says 'same script' from Vietnam war]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129711372.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Iran's Foreign Minister Seyed Abbas Araghchi criticized U.S. messaging on the regional conflict, comparing it to discredited Vietnam War briefings. He cited discrepancies between U.S. claims of victory and events like an F-35 being downed and U.S. aircraft carriers repositioning, suggesting a detached-from-reality narrative.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/detached-from-reality-iran-slams-us-over-winning-claims-says-same-script-from-vietnam-war/articleshow/129711372.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/detached-from-reality-iran-slams-us-over-winning-claims-says-same-script-from-vietnam-war/articleshow/129711372.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-21T05:28:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129711405,imgsize-421575.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[10 dead in South Korea car plant fire]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129711014.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A fire at a South Korea car parts plant killed 10 people, the Yonhap news agency reported early Saturday citing authorities, with rescuers still searching for four missing. A total of 170 workers were in the plant when the fire started, Yonhap reported.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/10-dead-in-south-korea-car-plant-fire/articleshow/129711014.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/10-dead-in-south-korea-car-plant-fire/articleshow/129711014.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-21T04:06:34+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129711081,imgsize-886576.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Clavicular breaks silence on contract claims as streamer VarisG reveals what really happened in Miami]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129710392.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Braden Clavicular Peters is facing claims that he asked people to sign contracts before joining his livestreams. Streamer VarisG said the situation felt forced and uncomfortable during a Miami meeting. Other clips and reports also raised similar concerns. Clavicular says these were normal NDAs, but the claims remain unproven and are still being debated online.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/clavicular-breaks-silence-on-contract-claims-as-streamer-varisg-reveals-what-really-happened-in-miami/articleshow/129710392.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/clavicular-breaks-silence-on-contract-claims-as-streamer-varisg-reveals-what-really-happened-in-miami/articleshow/129710392.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-21T03:51:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129710292,imgsize-2477201.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Middle East crisis: Trump says US 'close to meeting objectives', opposes ceasefire with Iran]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129709333.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[President Trump stated the U.S. is nearing its military objectives in the Middle East concerning Iran, aiming to degrade its missile capabilities and defense industry. He firmly rejected a ceasefire, asserting the U.S. is "obliterating the other side" and has "won." Trump also indicated other nations should guard the Strait of Hormuz.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/middle-east-crisis-trump-says-us-close-to-meeting-objectives-opposes-ceasefire-with-iran/articleshow/129709333.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/middle-east-crisis-trump-says-us-close-to-meeting-objectives-opposes-ceasefire-with-iran/articleshow/129709333.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-21T03:41:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129709478,imgsize-1194638.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Artemis II update: Four astronauts enter health quarantine ahead of record-breaking mission]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/artemis-ii-update-four-astronauts-enter-health-quarantine-ahead-of-record-breaking-mission/articleshow/129707283.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/artemis-ii-update-four-astronauts-enter-health-quarantine-ahead-of-record-breaking-mission/articleshow/129707283.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-21T03:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129707265,imgsize-52676.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Barron Trump turns 20: Twenty things you never knew about the most mysterious Trump]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129699812.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Barron Trump turns 20 today, and despite spending his entire life in one of the world's most scrutinised families, he remains its most private member. From a $150 million crypto fortune and a yerba mate start-up to quietly reshaping his father's social media strategy, the NYU sophomore is building something of his own. He just hasn't told anyone about it yet.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/barron-trump-turns-20-twenty-things-you-never-knew-about-the-most-mysterious-trump/articleshow/129699812.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/barron-trump-turns-20-twenty-things-you-never-knew-about-the-most-mysterious-trump/articleshow/129699812.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-21T03:20:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129709150,imgsize-992473.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Twitch streamer Uwo’s Lab turns old toilet into functional speaker, goes viral]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129708695.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Twitch streamer Uwo's Lab transformed an old toilet into a working speaker, dubbed the "Sh*twoofer," in a viral expe